{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# Méthode d'accès aux données\n## Exercices: Spark Dataframe\n\nAuteur: Christopher MEIER","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:51+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Méthode d&rsquo;accès aux données</h1>\n<h2>Exercices: Spark Dataframe</h2>\n<p>Auteur: Christopher MEIER</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469431_1784163190","id":"paragraph_1768388679709_252578792","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:51:51+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:51:51+0000"},{"text":"%md\n### Dataset loading\n\nNothing to modify in this section.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:51+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Dataset loading</h3>\n<p>Nothing to modify in this section.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469431_1552430429","id":"paragraph_1768388797559_110032450","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:51:51+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:51:51+0000"},{"text":"%spark\nval filename = \"/repo/data/IMDB-Movie-Data.csv\"\nval moviesDF = spark.read.format(\"csv\")\n    .option(\"sep\", \",\")\n    .option(\"inferSchema\", \"true\")\n    .option(\"header\", \"true\")\n    .load(filename)\n    .withColumn(\"Genre\", split(col(\"Genre\"), \",\"))\n    .withColumn(\"Actors\", split(col(\"Actors\"), \",\"))","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:51+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"val \u001b[1m\u001b[34mfilename\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /repo/data/IMDB-Movie-Data.csv\nval \u001b[1m\u001b[34mmoviesDF\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [Rank: int, Title: string ... 10 more fields]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=50"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=51"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469431_1422898302","id":"paragraph_1768388922726_987365176","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:51:52+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:51:51+0000"},{"text":"%md\n### Dataframe and SparkSQL\n\nFor all of the following exercices, write your queries in two different ways:\n\n* using the sql literal\n* using DataFrame API (select, where, etc.)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:52+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Dataframe and SparkSQL</h3>\n<p>For all of the following exercices, write your queries in two different ways:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>using the sql literal</li>\n<li>using DataFrame API (select, where, etc.)</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_1833337850","id":"paragraph_1768388926120_488225639","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:51:52+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:51:52+0000"},{"text":"%md\n#### Ex1 - Use the moviesDF DataFrame\n\n* Use the dataframe `moviesDF` already created when loading the data \n* Print the schema of moviesDF\n* Show the first 10 lines of the moviesDF as a table","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:52+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Ex1 - Use the moviesDF DataFrame</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Use the dataframe <code>moviesDF</code> already created when loading the data</li>\n<li>Print the schema of moviesDF</li>\n<li>Show the first 10 lines of the moviesDF as a table</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_679796711","id":"paragraph_1768388933243_430728711","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:51:52+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:51:52+0000"},{"text":"%spark\n// TODO students\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:52+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"ERROR","msg":[]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_883419773","id":"paragraph_1768389163650_1348201737","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"ERROR","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:51:52+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:51:52+0000"},{"text":"%md\n#### Ex2 - Show the movies (rank, title, votes, director) whose title contains \"City\" \n\nApply two different ways: \n\n* use the sql literal (`spark.sql`)\n* use DataFrame API (select, where, etc.)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Ex2 - Show the movies (rank, title, votes, director) whose title contains &ldquo;City&rdquo;</h4>\n<p>Apply two different ways:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>use the sql literal (<code>spark.sql</code>)</li>\n<li>use DataFrame API (select, where, etc.)</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_389748473","id":"paragraph_1768388940315_598314693","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%spark\n// TODO sql literal students\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:59+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"ERROR","msg":[]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_1460830699","id":"paragraph_1768389183117_1122833746","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"ERROR","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:51:59+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:51:59+0000"},{"text":"%spark\n// TODO DataFrame API students\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:52:01+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"ERROR","msg":[]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_195697934","id":"paragraph_1768389615394_46725386","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"ERROR","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:52:01+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:52:01+0000"},{"text":"%md\n#### Ex3 - Show the minimum, maximum and average rating of films per director. Sort the results by decreasing minimum rating.  ","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Ex3 - Show the minimum, maximum and average rating of films per director. Sort the results by decreasing minimum rating.</h4>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_1089833584","id":"paragraph_1768389056675_1187847645","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%spark\n// TODO students\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:52:09+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"ERROR","msg":[]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_431558479","id":"paragraph_1768389188876_861264650","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"ERROR","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:52:09+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:52:09+0000"},{"text":"%md\n#### Ex4 - Show the movie(s) having the minimum rating for each year. Show the title, year and the rating information in the result, order by increasing rating.\n\n**Example output**\n\n```plain\n+--------------------+----+------+\n|               title|year|rating|\n+--------------------+----+------+\n|      Disaster Movie|2008|   1.9|\n|Don't Fuck in the...|2016|   2.7|\n|Dragonball Evolution|2009|   2.7|\n...\n```","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Ex4 - Show the movie(s) having the minimum rating for each year. Show the title, year and the rating information in the result, order by increasing rating.</h4>\n<p><strong>Example output</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-plain\">+--------------------+----+------+\n|               title|year|rating|\n+--------------------+----+------+\n|      Disaster Movie|2008|   1.9|\n|Don't Fuck in the...|2016|   2.7|\n|Dragonball Evolution|2009|   2.7|\n...\n</code></pre>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_1762971293","id":"paragraph_1768389068205_816601066","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%spark\n// TODO students\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:52:11+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"ERROR","msg":[]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_547129680","id":"paragraph_1768389195990_117904945","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"ERROR","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:52:11+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:52:11+0000"},{"text":"%md\n#### Ex5 - Show the title of different movies having the same director. \n\n**Example output**\n\n```plain\n+------------------+--------------------+--------------------+\n|          director|              title1|              title2|\n+------------------+--------------------+--------------------+\n|        James Gunn|Guardians of the ...|               Super|\n|        James Gunn|Guardians of the ...|             Slither|\n|      Ridley Scott|          Prometheus|        Body of Lies|\n|      Ridley Scott|          Prometheus|         A Good Year|\n...\n```\n\nNote that when using the dataframe API:\n* You can use `===` to test equality of columns and `!==` to test non-equality of them\n* You can use the `as` keyword to make alias of column names and table names (check the reference documentation)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Ex5 - Show the title of different movies having the same director.</h4>\n<p><strong>Example output</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-plain\">+------------------+--------------------+--------------------+\n|          director|              title1|              title2|\n+------------------+--------------------+--------------------+\n|        James Gunn|Guardians of the ...|               Super|\n|        James Gunn|Guardians of the ...|             Slither|\n|      Ridley Scott|          Prometheus|        Body of Lies|\n|      Ridley Scott|          Prometheus|         A Good Year|\n...\n</code></pre>\n<p>Note that when using the dataframe API:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can use <code>===</code> to test equality of columns and <code>!==</code> to test non-equality of them</li>\n<li>You can use the <code>as</code> keyword to make alias of column names and table names (check the reference documentation)</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_655756897","id":"paragraph_1768389091644_997296440","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%spark\n// TODO student\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:52:14+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"ERROR","msg":[]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469432_1821224631","id":"paragraph_1768389336624_39161043","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"ERROR","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2026-01-14T11:52:14+0000","dateStarted":"2026-01-14T11:52:14+0000"},{"text":"%spark\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"enabled":true,"results":{},"editorSetting":{}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1768391469433_1205060300","id":"paragraph_1768391160393_1134702428","dateCreated":"2026-01-14T11:51:09+0000","status":"READY","results":{}}],"name":"spark_dataframe","id":"2MHKF5SFS","defaultInterpreterGroup":"spark","version":"0.12.0","noteParams":{},"noteForms":{},"angularObjects":{},"config":{"isZeppelinNotebookCronEnable":false,"looknfeel":"default","personalizedMode":"false"},"info":{"isRunning":false},"path":"/notebooks/spark_dataframe"}